SUMMARY:Honkai: Star Rail 4.8 Special Program (Estimated)
DESCRIPTION:Projected from the 42-day cycle\, with the stream about 12 days
  before launch (4.7 launched Nov 11).\n\nCodes expire at Dec 12\, 23:59 (U
 TC+8)\, 23:59 the day after the stream - 28 hours after the stream ends.\n
 \nAll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).\nEntries marked Estimated or TBC are
  projected from version cycles and may shift once officially announced.
