BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hsr-48-code@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261212T155900Z
DTEND:20261212T161400Z
SUMMARY:Star Rail 4.8 - Redemption codes expire (Computed)
DESCRIPTION:Valid 28 hours: stream starts Dec 11\, 19:30\, codes die Dec 12
 \, 23:59 (UTC+8).\n\nThree codes worth 300 Stellar Jade total\, plus chara
 cter and Light Cone ascension materials.\nOnce they expire they are gone -
  no reissues\, no appeals.\n\nRedeem in game under Phone > the ... menu (t
 op right) > Redemption Code\, or on the official redemption website.\nMiss
 ed the stream? The VOD description and the official preview page usually l
 ist all three codes.\n\nAll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).\nEntries marke
 d Estimated or TBC are projected from version cycles and may shift once of
 ficially announced.
LOCATION:Honkai: Star Rail - Redemption page
CATEGORIES:Honkai: Star Rail
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT2H
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Codes expire in 2 hours - redeem now if you haven't
END:VALARM
